### Get User Logged
GET http://localhost:3030/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{ token }}
Content-Type: application/json



### Update user by ID
PUT http://localhost:3030/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
	"name": "Leonardo Testa",
	"nickname": "TheOvniBoss" ,
	"user_metadata": { 
		"birthDate": "1981-04-22"
	}
}

### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3030/api/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
	"name": "Leonardo Testa",
	"nickname": "TheOvniBoss" ,
	"email": "leonardo@testa.com"
}


